```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User Browser
  participant FE as React Frontend
  participant BE as FastAPI Backend
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant RS as R Shiny

  U->>FE: User types query
  FE->>BE: GET /api/v1/search?q=...
  BE->>DB: SELECT ...
  DB-->>BE: Rows
  BE->>FE: JSON results
  FE->>U: Render list / charts
  FE-->>RS: (optional) Embed dashboard iframe
``` 